    {
      "id": "sec_hbj4e5y7n1",
      "preset": "starter/stack-12@1",
      "anchor": "becoming",
      "layout": {
        "mode": "stack",
        "columns": {
          "d": [
            12
          ]
        }
      },
      "style": {
        "colorTheme": "light-accent"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "blk_7j4zx9c68s",
          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "The premise"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "attrs": {
                    "level": 2
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "There is an art to becoming who you are."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Not becoming someone else."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Not perfecting yourself into some final form."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "But learning to see what is here. To know what is true. To loosen what obscures it. To listen for what wants to move through you. And to cultivate a life that can hold more of who you actually are."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "This is the heart of my work. A practice of remembering and becoming, again and again."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sec_y609t6y9n9",
      "preset": "starter/stack-12@1",
      "anchor": "true-nature-alignment",
      "layout": {
        "mode": "stack",
        "columns": {
          "d": [
            12
          ]
        }
      },
      "style": {
        "colorTheme": "light"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "blk_naqrv6hhq7",
          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "The thread beneath the work"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "attrs": {
                    "level": 2
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "True Nature Alignment"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "The practice of coming into closer relationship with what is true, and bringing life into greater coherence around it."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "It happens inwardly and outwardly. In the body. In story. In relationship. In expression. In work. In creativity. In the spaces we inhabit. In the land we tend."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "We align. We wander. We listen. We return."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sec_tg007e2pnp",
      "preset": "starter/stack-12@1",
      "anchor": "living-practice",
      "layout": {
        "mode": "stack",
        "columns": {
