                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "1:1 mentorship"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "attrs": {
                    "level": 2
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "The Thread"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "One life. Many threads."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "The Thread is a personalized mentorship for meeting the chapter you are actually living. There is no single curriculum for becoming. We begin with what is alive: where you are, what is changing, what is asking for attention, what you long for, what you are becoming."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "From there, I draw from the arts and practices I have spent my life studying and living to shape a journey around you."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "We follow the thread."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
